{
 "slug": "bluecart-alternative",
 "pageId": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
 "text_batches": [
  [
   {
    "label": "t0",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "c3df870f-ba8c-9aaf-796c-bb1249eeefa3"
     },
     "text": "20-30 Min"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t1",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fe9d"
     },
     "text": "Back on each order once the phone is out of it"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t2",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "3027ca32-6180-79a6-1a66-d9f911e27a08"
     },
     "text": "24-48 Hrs"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t3",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fea2"
     },
     "text": "Covers go-live for most distributors"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t4",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "448bf1fe-361f-3c13-6268-4572092953ba"
     },
     "text": "Same Day"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t5",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5feac"
     },
     "text": "Is first-order day for most kitchens"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t6",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "1cd5e3b3-4adf-89d2-b8a1-ba35fe69754d"
     },
     "text": "How It Comes Up"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t7",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8be"
     },
     "text": "When an alternative to BlueCart starts to look tempting"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t8",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8c2"
     },
     "text": "BlueCart sells reach. Join the marketplace, get listed in the endless aisle, be seen by restaurants across their network. That is worth keeping for a supplier chasing new accounts. Once an account is yours, though, the weekly reorder is a different job, and that is usually when a BlueCart competitor gets a look."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t9",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "eb7fd825-30c6-7275-9a2f-c98f68eb960f"
     },
     "text": "The reorder still comes by phone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t10",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8cc"
     },
     "text": "Plenty of accounts never order online at all. They call at seven in the morning or after close, and someone at your end writes each order up."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t11",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "bacfcf90-d337-55e1-9a02-49b2f6962e16"
     },
     "text": "Online ordering helps the ones who log in"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t12",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8d3"
     },
     "text": "BlueCart positions its Order Management Solution as a replacement for phone and email ordering, and for buyers who use it, it is. The kitchens who prefer talking to logging in are the gap."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t13",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "83921d0d-4ec1-911e-4420-fee5bfd13614"
     },
     "text": "Leaving would cost you the reach"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t14",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8da"
     },
     "text": "Coming off the marketplace would give up the new kitchens it brings in, and the regulars on the phone would still be on the phone. That is why a BlueCart alternative that takes the listing down is the wrong fix here."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t15",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "f5b08e4d-7503-2dae-cdd2-6f455d9fe83d"
     },
     "text": "The BlueCart alternative that leaves your listing up"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t16",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "f49b7c29-2a8e-b047-d714-742b52e0a34c"
     },
     "text": "What You Get"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t17",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "d4031fde-2fc3-b283-bb1c-784e741d725b"
     },
     "text": "Voice Ordering"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t18",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0ed"
     },
     "text": "The regular order, spoken"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t19",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0f1"
     },
     "text": "Your account holds the button and says what the kitchen needs. Items appear as lines with quantities, they fix anything wrong, and they send. Each item comes from their own guide, and they check every line before it goes."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t20",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4133"
     },
     "text": "The buyer looks at the list before anything leaves"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t21",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4139"
     },
     "text": "Done in the cooler or at the desk, at any hour"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t22",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe413f"
     },
     "text": "20 to 30 minutes back against the same order by phone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t23",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4145"
     },
     "text": "Interrupted halfway? It holds the order until they come back"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t24",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "d5d6538b-4114-51aa-7fff-aad875b7bfe3"
     },
     "text": "Order Guides"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t25",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea2"
     },
     "text": "Your range, at the prices you hold"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t26",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea6"
     },
     "text": "You send the guides you keep per customer. We load them against your SKUs at the price you hold for that account."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t27",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdead"
     },
     "text": "A kitchen sees nothing but the lines it buys"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t28",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb3"
     },
     "text": "Pricing and the catalog remain yours to set"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t29",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb9"
     },
     "text": "Change a guide once and it stands on the orders after"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t30",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdebf"
     },
     "text": "Every item maps to a SKU you already use"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t31",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "6555f9fc-4dcc-b940-f384-6001ce4db69f"
     },
     "text": "Delivery Formats"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t32",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb118"
     },
     "text": "It turns up the way your desk expects"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t33",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb11c"
     },
     "text": "A finished order leaves as an email carrying a PDF, Excel or Word file, or goes straight into your ERP over the API, over EDI, or into QuickBooks, in a shape your desk opens daily."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t34",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb123"
     },
     "text": "Addressed to a rep, or to the purchasing desk"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t35",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb129"
     },
     "text": "On a direct feed there is no rekeying at your end"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t36",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb12f"
     },
     "text": "Picking, billing and delivery carry on unchanged"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t37",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb135"
     },
     "text": "No part of your stack has to be retired first"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t38",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "099f67ce-06ef-dc92-c6e6-fdc4481f359f"
     },
     "text": "Inventory Visibility"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t39",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93a"
     },
     "text": "Stock in view as each order lands"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t40",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93e"
     },
     "text": "VoiceOrder Solutions carries real-time inventory visibility tied to what is being ordered, and the catalog updates as stock levels change. It is not the system of record for stock: yours stays in charge, and a demo shows how the levels connect."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t41",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df945"
     },
     "text": "Every line you carry, not only the quick movers"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t42",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df94b"
     },
     "text": "Fewer stockout surprises on a late, heavy order"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t43",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df951"
     },
     "text": "Numbers come out of whatever you count with now"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t44",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df957"
     },
     "text": "Nothing gets counted in our app"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t45",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "021e8cc1-41f6-a5cc-3995-2a8c101d005c"
     },
     "text": "Two Jobs"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t46",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64e7"
     },
     "text": "BlueCart finds the account, voice adds a quicker reorder"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t47",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64ec"
     },
     "text": "VoiceOrder Solutions is not a BlueCart replacement, because it cannot do the thing BlueCart is for. It adds on, so being listed on a marketplace is no reason to skip this."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t48",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da6507"
     },
     "text": "Meet them there, make reordering quick"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t49",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da650a"
     },
     "text": "A marketplace is a good way to meet an account you had no route to. Once they buy from you regularly, some will want a quicker way to reorder than logging in, and our app gives them one while the listing keeps working."
    }
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "label": "t50",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a6d"
     },
     "text": "Let each account order the way it likes"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t51",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a70"
     },
     "text": "Kitchens happy ordering through BlueCart can keep doing it. Regulars who would still rather call get an app that turns what they say into a list they check."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t52",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535624"
     },
     "text": "Our orders land where you choose"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t53",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535627"
     },
     "text": "Ours show up in whichever system you picked, over EDI, the API or QuickBooks, or as an email to your desk. Nothing about your BlueCart dashboard changes."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t54",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b4"
     },
     "text": "See a regular's reorder go from voice to your desk"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t55",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b8"
     },
     "text": "Twenty minutes. One account, one order spoken off a sample guide and signed off before it sends."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t56",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "6923bf1d-5310-eba9-bcb8-7266c5f85e97"
     },
     "text": "Getting Started"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t57",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ec7"
     },
     "text": "Three steps, and no listing to build"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t58",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "38293a1d-fb4c-9501-8014-28855f9128b6"
     },
     "text": "There is nothing new to put on the marketplace, and your BlueCart listing stays as it is. You send guides, we set up accounts, your kitchens start ordering."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t59",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ed6"
     },
     "text": "Email us your guides"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t60",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5eda"
     },
     "text": "Whatever format they are already in. Each account's lines and your prices go into a single admin screen, lined up with your codes."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t61",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ede"
     },
     "text": "We set up each customer"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t62",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ee3"
     },
     "text": "Accounts are created for each kitchen, which then downloads our app. Most have ordered before that day ends."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t63",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f00"
     },
     "text": "It arrives whole"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t64",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f04"
     },
     "text": "Signed off by the buyer, carrying a number and a time, in the shape your system expects."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t65",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a176"
     },
     "text": "BlueCart with VoiceOrder Solutions added."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t66",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "0c6cf9c7-bbe3-a64d-76b9-1539a90ac7c8"
     },
     "text": "Win there, reorder here."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t67",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "7b8acd63-aca8-b070-4eb6-f64ce47abebc"
     },
     "text": "Keep Both"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t68",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a179"
     },
     "text": "Nothing in this table gets taken away, because adding a tool should not cost you anything you have. BlueCart's own pitch is a marketplace that puts you in front of restaurants you have never sold to, and a BlueCart alternative search usually comes from the reorder side, not the reach. The two do not connect, and what we say about BlueCart was read on their site."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t69",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "1ff87819-9b94-6168-dfbb-e81fd6a5b236"
     },
     "text": "Feature"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t70",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a18d"
     },
     "text": "BlueCart + VoiceOrder Solutions"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t71",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a19e"
     },
     "text": "BlueCart on its own"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t72",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1be"
     },
     "text": "Reaching restaurants you do not supply yet"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t73",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1c8"
     },
     "text": "Accounts speak the reorder into an app"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t74",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1d5"
     },
     "text": "Orders keep their place if a cook is called away"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t75",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1e2"
     },
     "text": "Your buyer signs the order off before it sends"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t76",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1ec"
     },
     "text": "Promotions and offers for repeat business"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t77",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1f6"
     },
     "text": "Invoicing and payments"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t78",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a210"
     },
     "text": "A rep app and a wholesale CRM"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t79",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a21a"
     },
     "text": "Per-account ordering lists at the prices you set"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t80",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a224"
     },
     "text": "An order dashboard to confirm and track orders"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t81",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "30f8c397-6bf9-f190-2eb1-183dc2b44d9e"
     },
     "text": "FAQ"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t82",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf956"
     },
     "text": "What distributors on BlueCart ask us"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t83",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "8bf0eb84-6a8d-dd56-6a0e-8116d9416d3d"
     },
     "text": "Is a BlueCart alternative the only way to add spoken orders?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t84",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf967"
     },
     "text": "No, and the listing never has to come down. VoiceOrder Solutions adds an app where the accounts on your books say what they need and approve it, while BlueCart goes on bringing in kitchens that are new to you. Nothing gets turned off."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t85",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "ad9f0390-a776-7031-a95b-984cd1988c9e"
     },
     "text": "Is VoiceOrder Solutions better than BlueCart?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t86",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf973"
     },
     "text": "At finding new customers, no, and it is not a close call. That is their product and we do not have one. We help with the repeat order from an account already on your books: your range only, your prices, approved by the buyer. People who search for a BlueCart alternative are often after that second job, not a way out of the first."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t87",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "e219e293-819b-221b-6d80-7f8d2898a4d7"
     },
     "text": "Are VoiceOrder Solutions and BlueCart connected?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t88",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf97f"
     },
     "text": "No. The two products are not linked, and neither supports the other. Each delivers its orders into your own system independently, ours as an email with a file attached, over EDI or the API, or into QuickBooks."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t89",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "39590628-381c-9aea-6095-0746f7348939"
     },
     "text": "Won't our accounts be ordering in two places?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t90",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf98b"
     },
     "text": "Some may, and that can be fine. A kitchen you met on the marketplace can keep buying there. Offer our app to the regulars who still call your desk, since a spoken reorder from your own guide is where it saves the most time. Calls you go on taking get no order number from us; that only comes with orders sent through the app."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t91",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "0f73d180-08e9-596f-f264-a95de40f9593"
     },
     "text": "How do our prices appear in your app?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t92",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "7e541655-5a68-8f96-1273-8249a5c759bd"
     },
     "text": "Each account sees its own guide, priced the way you set it. BlueCart's Pricing Insights, which labels products as great, good or fair value, carries on for your marketplace listing."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t93",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "d9956fbb-a3d6-4b04-b3ab-98b6f5ae509f"
     },
     "text": "How fast can accounts begin ordering?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t94",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "4446ea80-4c7a-f2a8-f0de-0a222818c94f"
     },
     "text": "For most distributors this is live inside 24 to 48 hours, with a first order usually in on the same day. BlueCart says theirs can be live within days too, and since the listing stays up, there is nothing to time around."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t95",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "93ba65b0-4eb0-c64e-d0c0-933cd7a92b1d"
     },
     "text": "How do the costs compare?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t96",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf997"
     },
     "text": "Neither of us publishes a figure. Theirs follows a demo; ours comes as a quote once we have talked. With the listing kept, the only new cost is the voice reorder, and a quote shows what that is."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t97",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-990427524516"
     },
     "text": "Where do the BlueCart details on this page come from?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t98",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5ad4674c1a37e56403",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-99042752451e"
     },
     "text": "Everything here came from bluecart.com, read 10 October 2026: the marketplace positioning off the headline, the Pricing Insights and endless aisle descriptions off their product list, and the setup line off their FAQ. We have left their transaction and funding figures alone, because those are theirs. If any of it has moved on, the fault is here, not there."
    }
   }
  ]
 ],
